== Biography ==


---- /!\ '''Edit conflict - other version:''' ----

---- /!\ '''Edit conflict - other version:''' ----
Hailing from Milwaukee, Wisconsin, The Revomatics consist of local music veterans who bring a high octane set of popular surf songs with an injection of 1960s garage rock to the stage each time they perform. Often joined by go-go dancers, the band really puts the pedal to the metal. The Revomatics were honored to open for Dick Dale in 2011 at Shank Hall in Milwaukee. The band actively performs at car shows, Tiki events and various festivals. Please contact info@therevomatics.com for more information.

